{"title": "Scroll of Animate Dead", "pageid": 16421, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scroll_of_Animate_Dead", "categories": ["Scrolls", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp/300px-Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp, /w/images/b/ba/Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scroll of Animate Dead image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp/300px-Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Scroll_of_Animated_Dead_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scroll of Animate Dead</b> is a single-use scroll that allows the user to cast <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Animate Dead</a> as an action.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scrolls\" title=\"Scrolls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/37px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/49px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Scrolls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png/24px-Scrolls_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Scrolls_Icon.png\" clas